        ["2"] = <"2. Kaufmann P, Levy G, Thompson JL, Delbene ML, Battista V, Gordon PH, Rowland LP, Levin B, Mitsumoto H. The ALSFRSr predicts survival time in an ALS clinic population. Neurology. 2005 Jan 11;64(1):38-43. doi: 10.1212/01.WNL.0000148648.38313.64. PMID: 15642901.">
